Title: Para families of orthogonal polynomials
Authors: St\'ephane Z. Beaulac, Nicolas Cramp\'e, Quentin Labriet, Lucia Morey,
  Rafael I. Nepomechie, Luc Vinet
Categories: math-ph math.MP math.RT
Comments: 44 pages
